# LLM From Here conventions

## Canonical config and outputs

- Production show config: `configs/configv3.yaml` (CI/release workflows use this).
- Run output: `{output_dir}/{show_name}_runN/` (default `outputs/`).
- Per-run logs: `show_runner.log` (main), `agent_trace.log` (guest agent + filter LLM). Legacy `showRunner.log` is not written.

## OpenRouter model slugs

- Use `openrouter:<slug>` when constructing `LlmSession` or YAML `model_routing` values (e.g. `openrouter:openai/gpt-4o-mini`).
- Bare slugs like `openai/gpt-4o-mini` are not routed through OpenRouter unless prefixed.
- Local Ollama: `ollama:model-name` (ShowRunner warns if Ollama is down).

## Model routing

YAML `global_params.model_routing`: `filter_model`, `structured_model`, `prose_model`.
Env overrides: `LLMFH_FILTER_MODEL`, `LLMFH_STRUCTURED_MODEL`, `LLMFH_PROSE_MODEL`.

## Lyria background music

- Off by default; enable with `LLMFH_LYRIA_ENABLED=1`.
- Model: `OPENROUTER_MUSIC_MODEL` (default `google/lyria-3-pro-preview`).
- When Lyria is off or fails, `music_generator_openrouter` falls back to YouTube.

## Structured outputs

- Prefer Pydantic models in `src/llm_from_here/schemas/` + `LlmSession.run_structured`.
- Inventory: `docs/llm_schema_inventory.md`.
- pydantic-ai `Agent` retries: use `AgentRetries(tools=N, output=M)`, not deprecated `output_retries`.

## Tests

- Unit tests must not require `OPENROUTER_API_KEY`; mock `OpenRouterModel` / `Agent` or `LlmSession` at call sites.
- CI runs `pytest tests/test*.py` only; integration tests live under `tests/integration/`.
